  "body": "At the TPAC 2020 discussion @asutherland suggested that we should consider maximum scope size limits.  While its theoretically possible for sites to stick large amounts of info encoded in the scope URL today, the scope list mechanism might encourage further size growth.  We should have an interoperable agreement as to what is too much.",
